'''Alligator''' is a {{Rarity|l|nolink=y}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from water in the {{zone|Backwater Bayou}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Alligator''' can be fished up from water in the {{zone|Backwater Bayou}}. It requires {{skl|fishing|20}} or higher to be fished up.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''Alligator''' is {{Green|100}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|1%|1|100|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:
